# UX workflow: first-frame Base/Modulation projection across navigation.
# Purpose: proves cold entry, page change, and Track change each render their
# own resolved tuple without a second navigation gesture used as refresh.
# Expect: capture_changed:cold_projection=page_2_projection, capture_changed:page_2_projection=track_2_projection, capture_match:track_2_projection=macro_reentered

0 scenario macro-initial-projection
300 capture screen cold_projection

# PAGE is one focus step from TRACK; the first navigation lands directly on
# Page 2 and must already show its distinct Base plus modulation rail.
440 tap NAV 60
580 encoder NAV 1
720 tap NAV 60
940 capture screen page_2_projection

# Return focus through STEP to TRACK, then land on Track 2 in one turn. The
# first Track 2 frame must be coherent without toggling away and back.
1080 tap NAV 60
1220 tap NAV 60
1360 encoder NAV 1
1600 capture screen track_2_projection

# Leave Macro for Project, then return through the same global selector. View
# entry must reuse/publish the coherent Track 2 tuple, not repaint Out as Base.
1740 button LEFT_TOP down
1860 encoder NAV 1
1980 encoder NAV 1
2100 button LEFT_TOP up
2320 capture screen project_view

2460 button LEFT_TOP down
2580 encoder NAV -1
2700 encoder NAV -1
2820 button LEFT_TOP up
3100 capture screen macro_reentered
